  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/855/mp_darkrpg_fabric_header-webp.webp\" alt=\"黑暗RPG Fabric版\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/861/mp_darkrpg_fabric_description-webp.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>黑暗RPG是一款将《我的世界》转变为完整奇幻RPG MMO的模组包，包含1800+任务、魔法、起源、技能、Boss战和多人混乱体验。</p><p>（以下特性将永久改变您的原版体验）</p><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">性能优化</span></strong> - 专为性能和低配电脑打造！（相比其他大型模组包）</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">多人游戏</span></strong> - 专为服务器打造！可自建服务器。使用多人游戏板块中的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>链接或点击顶部/底部链接立即创建您的服务器！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">内置MMO官方服务器</span></strong> - 与他人和朋友在线游玩！只需下载包，点击多人游戏并加入服务器！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">终极角色扮演体验</span></strong> - 选择你的方面→起源→类型→神圣方面→职业。混搭创造独特可能性！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">任务系统</span></strong> - 1800+任务。按[I]键查看任务和游戏内指南，按[L]键查看基于进度的任务</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">完整货币系统</span></strong> - 与其他玩家交易</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">赌场</span></strong> - 使用钻石货币赢取稀有物品。立即玩苦力怕赌场和经验赌场，赢大奖！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">拍卖行和商店</span></strong> - 向其他玩家出售你的商品</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">队伍系统</span></strong> - 创建队伍并使用队伍聊天与朋友交流</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">合成配方</span></strong> - 超过100个原版中没有的自定义配方</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">飞行与陆地坐骑</span></strong> - 支持多名乘客的自定义飞行物品，非常适合多人游戏！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">额外武器与盔甲</span></strong> - 时尚展示！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">魔法系统</span></strong> - 法杖、法术、特殊附魔与附魔台</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">技能系统</span></strong> - 提升魔法、战斗、挖掘等级，专精不同学派</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">模组配置菜单</span></strong> - 按喜好配置模组</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">小地图与世界地图</span></strong> - 为你的队伍创建路径点</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">领地认领系统</span></strong> - 保护物品免受其他玩家侵扰</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">传送石碑</span></strong> - 传送至基地和朋友处</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">特殊Boss</span></strong> - 击败全新邪恶怪物获得战利品</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">额外生物群系</span></strong> - 探索激动人心的美丽区域</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">额外方块与物品</span></strong> - 快乐建筑！</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#a3ff1f\">字体、准星与光影支持</span></strong> - 包内附赠字体、光影和准星</li>\n</ul><p>黑暗RPG已预装在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>上！一键即可开始在线游玩。<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a>是领先的我的世界服务器解决方案。<strong>今天就和朋友一起玩黑暗RPG吧！</strong><br><strong>点击下方横幅</strong>或点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>并使用代码'gamerpotion'即可享受25%折扣！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/858/mp_darkrpg_fabric_promob-webp.webp\" alt=\"获取服务器！\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/220/mp_darkrpg_fabric_faq-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></strong></p><ul>\n<li>此包包含更多生活便利模组。拥有超过400+模组，您将获得数小时的乐趣！如有任何问题，请加入我们的Discord（下方链接）</li>\n<li>建议使用<a href=\"https://download.curseforge.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge应用</a>分配至少6-8GB内存来游玩黑暗RPG</li>\n<li>寻找Forge版本？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗RPG Forge模组包</a></li>\n<li>寻找Redux 1.18.2版本？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗RPG REDUX模组包</a></li>\n<li><strong>请将Java更新至至少17.0.11，以避免在对抗Boss时出现粒子崩溃问题。前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gamerpotion.net%252f2024%252f12%252fhow-to-resolve-packet-overload.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>了解更多信息。</strong></li>\n<li>加入服务器时遇到起源ID错误？创建一个单人世界，选择起源和职业直到完全加载，然后退出并重新加入服务器</li>\n<li>寻找任务？按<strong>L</strong>键打开进度菜单，点击书籍图标查看基于DarkQuesting进度的任务。按<strong>I</strong>键打开FTB任务菜单，将鼠标悬停在左侧查看不同任务分类。</li>\n</ul><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/221/mp_darkrpg_fabric_youtube-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oMjs0Xpf6PU\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vHM1u9TVOBY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n6sw2Vtfb7E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NKYG7phGaPA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zTILoyrgNPU\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BdVHfrNjiI0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vAVMS_1tTro?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jnt9g0dfD2E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5sL5Pls2MBo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZQqrsZF2gRY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ust0Iqv8t3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/222/mp_darkrpg_fabric_discord-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1644/223/mp_darkrpg_fabric_kofi-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://medi